// IMS_FEATURE_TIERS below files it under the plan featureCatalog.js sells it in. Help used to hand-file
// every entry, and by S848 seven sat under the wrong plan and the six Crest Suite Pro pages under IMS
// plans they are not part of (DOCS-1). helpFeatureTiers.test.js holds the catalog to AuthContext.
